(7356146, 1150977, 16106, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones, and a pretty exact recreation, but I miss that shaft of light Enzo shot into the water that added another dimension into the water and added a twist on the classic pier shot.</td>', 'Lovely tones, and a pretty exact recreation, but I miss that shaft of light Enzo shot into the water that added another dimension into the water and added a twist on the classic pier shot.', '2015-06-01 17:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
