(7357464, 1151066, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the blue, Brennan. Gorgeous photo, as are the others from this outing. I wonder if it has ever happened before that triplets have ended up together on the front page. What a phenomenal result.</td>', 'Congratulations on the blue, Brennan. Gorgeous photo, as are the others from this outing. I wonder if it has ever happened before that triplets have ended up together on the front page. What a phenomenal result.', '2015-06-05 06:14:31.000000', NULL, 0),
