(7357541, 1151039, 108069, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> I think the original is better, the crop is entirely different also. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Indeed. And why did you plant those trees and build those buildings? It was a much more powerful photo as a solitary figure cut against the sky.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: I think the original is better, the crop is entirely different also.  Indeed. And why did you plant those trees and build those buildings? It was a much more powerful photo as a solitary figure cut against the sky.', '2015-06-05 11:14:13.000000', NULL, 0),
