(7357796, 1151039, 12253, '<td valign="top">Fine image Mark!<br/> <br/>Perhaps some people do not realize that this is Pemaquid Point light rather than Castle Hill (or perhaps they are being tongue and cheek and I didn''t catch it).  I don''t know of many lights with the charm that Castle Hill has, and also so close to the shoreline.  But it''s a fine, and different shot of Pemaquid than the usual reflection shots (I''m guilty of that).<br/> <br/>And you had a better (clouded) sky than I did!<br/> <br/>(Also, not that it matters, except in the interpretation of my title...this is sunrise, Sailors Delight was sunset, "Red skies at night, Sailors Delight!"!)<br/> <br/>In the end, you took home the Yellow, tied with the original!  Congratulations.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Fine image Mark! Perhaps some people do not realize that this is Pemaquid Point light rather than Castle Hill (or perhaps they are being tongue and cheek and I didn''t catch it).  I don''t know of many lights with the charm that Castle Hill has, and also so close to the shoreline.  But it''s a fine, and different shot of Pemaquid than the usual reflection shots (I''m guilty of that). And you had a better (clouded) sky than I did! (Also, not that it matters, except in the interpretation of my title...this is sunrise, Sailors Delight was sunset, "Red skies at night, Sailors Delight!"!) In the end, you took home the Yellow, tied with the original!  Congratulations. ', '2015-06-06 10:04:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7357853, 1150763, 98339, '<td valign="top">I think you did do it justice!!!  I like that you used different colors which to me added more dimension.  And to be truthful...even "I" couldn''t re-do this...it''s always a fluke when it happens.  Good job!!!</td>', 'I think you did do it justice!!!  I like that you used different colors which to me added more dimension.  And to be truthful...even "I" couldn''t re-do this...it''s always a fluke when it happens.  Good job!!!', '2015-06-06 17:12:36.000000', NULL, 0),
