(7357859, 1150752, 19825, '<td valign="top">I like this one, Tom. It has a much brighter color palette, and I really like the layered look of your reflections. We both have the hanging arm of a mannequin. Yours arm adds much more -- echoing the other arms in the shot. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like this one, Tom. It has a much brighter color palette, and I really like the layered look of your reflections. We both have the hanging arm of a mannequin. Yours arm adds much more -- echoing the other arms in the shot. Nicely done.', '2015-06-06 17:46:02.000000', NULL, 0),
